        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-1617, Traditional Rope Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe rope design of this cabinet handle is a true classic beauty. The detailing really highlights the finishes--and there are 8 finishes to choose from. This Rope Bow Pull Made by RK International is available in 2 sizes: 3 inch center to center and 3-1/2 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-1617 Rope Bow Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-1617</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-1603</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
